								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" >Start with a patch of soil</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Sow seeds, water your crops, and bring home the harvest. Sell your produce, buy supplies, and plan what to grow next as the seasons change.</p><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317160/extras/bd0711c9623ca8a8e01ed643c95c21e7.avif?t=1793841768" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317160/extras_big/bd0711c9623ca8a8e01ed643c95c21e7.webp?t=1793841768 width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >A little star makes a harvest special</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Crops come in Normal, Silver, Gold, and Purple Star qualities. Keep harvesting each crop to unlock rarer qualities, then record your prized specimens in the crop guide.</p><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317160/extras/c0aa8a31d9f23080e32b367427bb0b3e.avif?t=1793841768" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317160/extras_big/c0aa8a31d9f23080e32b367427bb0b3e.webp?t=1793841768 width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >Grow into better tools</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Work your way from wooden tools to Purple Gold equipment. Explore the forest and mine, gather materials, and visit the smithy to prepare for your next day on the farm.</p><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317160/extras/921c813fc44636f5f96599a569c3e9e0.avif?t=1793841768" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317160/extras_big/921c813fc44636f5f96599a569c3e9e0.webp?t=1793841768 width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >Get to know the valley</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Visit the villagers, listen to their stories, and help with their commissions. Between harvests, follow the paths beyond your farm and find your place in this small pixel world.</p><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317160/extras/499a51ce22c80bbf5185a325e234abe4.avif?t=1793841768" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317160/extras_big/499a51ce22c80bbf5185a325e234abe4.webp?t=1793841768 width=1560 height=878 /></span>						</div>
					</div>
